<title>USA: Trans World Airlines to match fare cuts.</title>
<headline>Trans World Airlines to match fare cuts.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS, Mo. 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trans World Airlines Inc said Monday it will match lower air fares on competitive routes initiated by Delta Air Lines.</p>
<p>&quot;We are matching Delta on competitive routes with the same restrictions and availabilities,&quot; said TWA spokesman John McDonald.</p>
<p>Earlier, Delta announced a winter fare sale offering discounts of up to 40 percent on flights throughout North America, Europe, Asia and the Caribbean.</p>
<p>		((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
